   "morning_observation": "Tuesday, February 2, 2016. The local radio plays three bright notes and announces a groundhog forecast in the town square. A delivery van backfires twice.",
   "episodes_in_order": [
    "6:00 am in inn: Rita reaches the square. Phil says: Morning, Rita. I'm just grabbing a coffee while you check the schedule. Phil spends the period at the inn. You see Larry at the square.",
    "9:30 am in square: Rita spends the period at the square. Larry says: Rita, the bandstand is over there. I'm scanning for a wide before they start tuning. Larry looks around.",
    "1:00 pm in square: Rita records the town band on its afternoon stand. Larry says: I'll just listen to the band for a bit and watch the setup. Larry stays for the band's cornet solo. Rita invites Larry on the crew radio to contribute to the evening slot."
   ]
  },
  {
   "most_recent_own_plan": "Capture the band's performance for the 7 PM bulletin and have Larry send the footage."
  }
 ],
